# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — raw-Makefile 库 package() copy 保留中间层级致 CMakeDeps "Library not found in package" ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-18
# Software: list 0.4.1
# Gate: conan-verify G2 / test_package find_package
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# 查重: DRAFT-matchit / DRAFT-gulrak 仅覆盖 include 侧头文件双层嵌套；
# 本条目新增 lib 侧 build/ src/ 中间层级 + cmakedeps Library not found error 面

id:                     DRAFT-list-0.4.1-conan-copy-libdir-cmakedeps
trigger_tool:           conan|conan create|conan-verify|cmake|test_package
phase:                  package|testing|verification
error_signature:        Library '[^']+' not found in package|conan_package_library_targets|cmakedeps_macros\.cmake.*message

severity:               2
category:               conan, packaging, recipe, cmake
match_keywords:         conanfile, package(), copy(), conan.tools.files.copy, raw-makefile,
                         build/, src/, intermediate dir, lib/build, Library not found in package,
                         CMakeDeps, cmakedeps_macros, cpp_info.libs, find_package, pattern, src, dst,
                         basic_layout, source_folder, build_folder

title:                  raw-Makefile 库 package() copy() 保留 build/ src/ 中间层级，
                        库落盘 lib/build/ 致 CMakeDeps "Library not found in package"

root_cause: >
  conan.tools.files.copy(pattern, src, dst) 的 pattern 含目录（如 "build/libxxx.a"）时
  复制保留其尾部目录层级；raw-Makefile 库（无 configure）在 basic_layout 下产物位于
  source_folder/build/、头文件位于 source_folder/src/。dst 指向 package/lib、include 时
  落盘为 lib/build/libxxx.a、include/clibs/src/xxx.h，CMakeDeps 仅搜索 lib/、include/，
  conan_package_library_targets 报 "Library not found in package"，
  test_package find_package 在 configure 阶段失败（G2 FAIL）。

affected_scope:          所有产物带中间目录层（build/、src/）的 raw-Makefile / 非标准布局
                         库的 Conan 2 package()；copy 保留 pattern 尾部目录语义对全部
                         Conan 2 配方通用

verification_cmd: |
  conan create <recipe> -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
  # 失败特征: cmakedeps_macros.cmake:81 Library 'xxx' not found in package
  find package_folder -name '*.a'   # 错误态: package/lib/build/libxxx.a

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           copy-src-dst-symmetric-join
rec_description: >
  copy() 的 src 精确 join 到产物所在子目录（source_folder/build、source_folder/src），
  dst 精确到包内目标目录（package/lib、package/include/clibs），pattern 用裸文件名，
  对称 join 消除中间层级；禁止用含 build/、src/ 前缀的 pattern 指向整个 source_folder。
rec_command: >
  copy(self, "libclibs_list.a",
       src=os.path.join(self.source_folder, "build"),
       dst=os.path.join(self.package_folder, "lib"))
  copy(self, "list.h",
       src=os.path.join(self.source_folder, "src"),
       dst=os.path.join(self.package_folder, "include", "clibs"))

forbid_1_pattern:       copy(self, "build/libxxx.a", self.source_folder, package/lib)
forbid_1_reason:        pattern 保留 build/ 尾部目录层 → lib/build/libxxx.a，CMakeDeps 找不到
forbid_2_pattern:       copy(self, "src/xxx.h", self.source_folder, package/include/clibs)
forbid_2_reason:        pattern 保留 src/ 尾部目录层 → include/clibs/src/xxx.h，include 路径错误

principles:             P012
similar_to:             DRAFT-matchit-r01-conan-copy-pattern-dir-keep,
                        DRAFT-gulrak-filesystem-1.5.8-headeronly-copy-nested-include
caused_by:              basic_layout + raw-Makefile 产物目录结构
prerequisite_of:
conflicts_with:

